{
    "chapter_num": 10,
    "verses_count": 36,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ahab’s Seventy Sons Killed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Ahab had seventy sons in Samaria. And Jehu wrote and sent letters to Samaria, to the rulers of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "So with MT, Syr., Tg.; LXX Samaria; Vg. city"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jezreel, to the elders, and to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "the guardians of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "those who reared Ahab’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sons,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " saying:"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now as soon as this letter comes to you, since your master’s sons "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with you, and you have chariots and horses, a fortified city also, and weapons, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "choose the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "most upright"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "best qualified of your master’s sons, set "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on his father’s throne, and fight for your master’s house."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But they were exceedingly afraid, and said, “Look, two kings could not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. stand before"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "stand up to him; how then can we stand?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of the house, and he who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in charge of the city, the elders also, and those who reared "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the sons,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sent to Jehu, saying, “We "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your servants, we will do all you tell us; but we will not make anyone king. Do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "what is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " good in your sight.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he wrote a second letter to them, saying:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for me and will obey my voice, take the heads of the men, your master’s sons, and come to me at Jezreel by this time tomorrow."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the king’s sons, seventy persons, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with the great men of the city, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " were rearing them. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So it was, when the letter came to them, that they took the king’s sons and slaughtered seventy persons, put their heads in baskets and sent "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to him at Jezreel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then a messenger came and told him, saying, “They have brought the heads of the king’s sons.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “Lay them in two heaps at the entrance of the gate until morning.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So it was, in the morning, that he went out and stood, and said to all the people, “You "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " righteous. Indeed I conspired against my master and killed him; but who killed all these? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Know now that nothing shall fall to the earth of the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " spoke concerning the house of Ahab; for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " has done what He spoke by His servant Elijah.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jehu killed all who remained of the house of Ahab in Jezreel, and all his great men and his close acquaintances and his priests, until he left him none remaining."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ahaziah’s Forty-two Brothers Killed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he arose and departed and went to Samaria. On the way, at "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or The Shearing House"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beth Eked of the Shepherds, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jehu met with the brothers of Ahaziah king of Judah, and said, “Who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " you?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they answered, “We "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the brothers of Ahaziah; we have come down to greet the sons of the king and the sons of the queen mother.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “Take them alive!” So they took them alive, and killed them at the well of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or The Shearing House"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beth Eked, forty-two men; and he left none of them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Rest of Ahab’s Family Killed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when he departed from there, he "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. found"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "met Jehonadab the son of Rechab, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "coming"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to meet him; and he greeted him and said to him, “Is your heart right, as my heart "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " toward your heart?”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jehonadab answered, “It is.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Jehu said,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " “If it is, give "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your hand.” So he gave "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " his hand, and he took him up to him into the chariot. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then he said, “Come with me, and see my zeal for the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ".” So they had him ride in his chariot. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when he came to Samaria, he killed all who remained to Ahab in Samaria, till he had destroyed them, according to the word of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " which He spoke to Elijah."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Worshipers of Baal Killed"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jehu gathered all the people together, and said to them, “Ahab served Baal a little, Jehu will serve him much. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now therefore, call to me all the prophets of Baal, all his servants, and all his priests. Let no one be missing, for I have a great sacrifice for Baal. Whoever is missing shall not live.” But Jehu acted deceptively, with the intent of destroying the worshipers of Baal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Jehu said, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Consecrate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Proclaim a solemn assembly for Baal.” So they proclaimed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jehu sent throughout all Israel; and all the worshipers of Baal came, so that there was not a man left who did not come. So they came into the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple of Baal, and the temple of Baal was full from one end to the other. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said to the one in charge of the wardrobe, “Bring out vestments for all the worshipers of Baal.” So he brought out vestments for them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Jehu and Jehonadab the son of Rechab went into the temple of Baal, and said to the worshipers of Baal, “Search and see that no servants of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are here with you, but only the worshipers of Baal.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So they went in to offer sacrifices and burnt offerings. Now Jehu had appointed for himself eighty men on the outside, and had said, “"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "If"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " any of the men whom I have brought into your hands escapes, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "whoever lets him escape, it shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " his life for the life of the other.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now it happened, as soon as he had made an end of offering the burnt offering, that Jehu said to the guard and to the captains, “Go in "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " kill them; let no one come out!” And they killed them with the edge of the sword; then the guards and the officers threw "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " out, and went into the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. city"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "inner room of the temple of Baal. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they brought the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sacred"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pillars out of the temple of Baal and burned them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they broke down the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sacred"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pillar of Baal, and tore down the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. house"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "temple of Baal and made it a refuse dump to this day. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thus Jehu destroyed Baal from Israel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "However Jehu did not turn away from the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, who had made Israel sin, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the golden calves that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " at Bethel and Dan. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " said to Jehu, “Because you have done well in doing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "what is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " right in My sight, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " have done to the house of Ahab all that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in My heart, your sons shall sit on the throne of Israel to the fourth "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "generation."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Jehu "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "was not careful"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "took no heed to walk in the law of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " God of Israel with all his heart; for he did not depart from the sins of Jeroboam, who had made Israel sin."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death of Jehu"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In those days the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " began to cut off "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "parts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Israel; and Hazael conquered them in all the territory of Israel "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "from the Jordan eastward: all the land of Gilead—Gad, Reuben, and Manasseh—from Aroer, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the River Arnon, including Gilead and Bashan."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the rest of the acts of Jehu, all that he did, and all his might, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " they not written in the book of the chronicles of the kings of Israel? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Jehu "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Died and joined his ancestors"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
